.", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "frn5le12ob05re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : J'ai d\u00e9j\u00e0 une bonne impression.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Formateur</span> : Qu'est-ce que vous pensez de la revue&nbsp;? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : C'est ma publication pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9e.  <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Formateur</span> : Qu'est-ce qui vous fait dire \u00e7a, si je peux me permettre&nbsp;?", "id": 2, "time": "24500"}, {"image": "frn5le12ob05re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Je pense qu'il y a de nombreux articles \u00e0 int\u00e9r\u00eat g\u00e9n\u00e9ral qui r\u00e9pondent bien aux besoins des lecteurs.  <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Formateur</span> :  Je suis content de l'entendre. Avez-vous des questions avant de commencer&nbsp;?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Serait-il possible de revoir mes responsabilit\u00e9s lors de la formation&nbsp; ?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Formateur</span> :  Oui, pas de probl\u00e8me.", "id": 3, "time": "33600"}]}}], "_data": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"audiosrc": "frn5le12ob05re6aud01", "coverimg": "frn5le12ob05re6img01.jpg", "images": []}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Charlotte est en formation au travail", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Former la nouvelle employ\u00e9e", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 12, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "L'apprenant fait usage d'une information pr\u00e9cise concernant le travail et les lieux de travail des gens dans des situations communicatives.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "frn5le12ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Le verbe <span class=\"italic\">expliquer</span> au futur simple", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Le verbe <span class=\"italic\">expliquer</span> se conjugue au futur simple comme les autres verbes se terminant en ER. On prend le radical de l'infinitif et on ajoute la terminaison appropri\u00e9e selon le sujet.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sujet\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Verbe\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"j'\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"expliquerai\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tu\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"expliqueras\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"il/elle/on\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"expliquera\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"nous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"expliquerons\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"vous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"expliquerez\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ils/elles\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"expliqueront\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Nous ferons le tour de vos nouvelles responsabilit\u00e9s et je vous expliquerai l'organisation du bureau.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Nous vous expliquerons les proc\u00e9dures en cas d'incendie. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Les verbes du premier groupe subissent plusieurs changements orthographiques :", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Avec les verbes qui sont form\u00e9s en <span class=\"strong\">e + consonne + er</span>, soit le <span class=\"strong\">e</span> devient <span class=\"strong\">\u00e8</span> (<span class=\"italic\">j'ach\u00e8terai</span>), soit on double la consonne (<span class=\"italic\">j'appellerai</span>).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Avec les verbes <span class=\"strong\">yer</span>, le <span class=\"strong\">y</span> devient <span class=\"strong\">i</span> (<span class=\"italic\">je paierai</span>).", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Le conditionnel de politesse \u00e0 la forme interrogative", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "On utilise souvent la forme conditionnelle comme signe de politesse, surtout lorsque l'on fait une demande. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Serait-il possible de...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Pourriez-vous...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Pourrais-tu...\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Pourriez-vous me rappeler votre nom ? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Serait-il possible de revoir mes responsabilit\u00e9s lors de la formation ?", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "Voici des mots que vous utilisez lors d'une formation au travail.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "l'associ\u00e9, l'associ\u00e9e", "type": "name"}, {"content": "personne qui est li\u00e9e \u00e0 une ou \u00e0 plusieurs autres personnes par des int\u00e9r\u00eats communs", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (nom m./f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple: Mon r\u00f4le est de former les nouveaux associ\u00e9s.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le12ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la revue", "type": "name"}, {"content": "magazine", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Qu'est ce que vous pensez de notre revue ?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le12ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la publication", "type": "name"}, {"content": "\u00e9crit publi\u00e9 ; magazine, brochures, etc.", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : C'est ma publication pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9e", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le12ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le personnel", "type": "name"}, {"content": "ensemble d'une \u00e9quipe de travail", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Je vous expliquerai l'organisation du personnel au bureau.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le12ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "si je peux me permettre", "type": "name"}, {"content": "formule de politesse pour introduire son opinion ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Pourquoi aimez-vous cette revue, si je peux me permettre&nbsp;?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn5le12ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Choisissez un domaine de travail.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Produisez un dialogue de 8 \u00e0 10 lignes. Une personne est formateur. L'autre personne est un nouvel employ\u00e9.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "L'employ\u00e9 fait au moins une demande raisonnable et une demande d\u00e9raisonnable. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Le formateur r\u00e9agit aux demandes. Il accepte la demande raisonnable et refuse la demande d\u00e9raisonnable.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Pratiquez le dialogue \u00e0 voix haute .", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Changez les r\u00f4les.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "Je parle du travail.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je fais des demandes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je r\u00e9ponds aux demandes.", "type": "text"}]}]}